{"study_accession":"PRJNA663423","secondary_study_accession":"SRP282392","title":"Next Generation Sequencing Analysis of Gene Profiles of Healthy, Hyperlipidaemia, Familail Hyperlipidemia, Coronary Heart Disease and Familial Coronary Heart Disease","description":"To explore genes indicating a risk of familial (premature) coronary heart disease (FH-CHD) development in familial hypercholesterolaemia (FH), 30 Thai male volunteers were enrolled: 7 healthy controls (N), 6 patients with hypercholesterolaemia (H), 4 with FH, 10 with CHD, and 3 with FH-CHD. Transcriptome data were investigated using next-generation sequencing analysis in whole blood (n = 3). Genes that were significantly expressed in both FH and FH-CHD, but not in N, H, and CHD groups, were selected, functionally analysed, and validated by quantitative real-time PCR (RT-qPCR). We identified 55 intersecting genes between FH and FH-CHD groups. The expressions of intersecting genes that shared between FH and FH-CHD groups are potential for further development as predictive markers for FH-CHD in FH patients.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":15,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN16132258","study_accession":"PRJNA663423","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Healthy donor_1","description":"Healthy donor_1","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-09-16","attributes":[["isolate","0006"],["age","23y"],["biomaterial_provider","Yaowapa Maneerat"],["sex","male"],["tissue","whole blood"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR12640675","experiment_accession":"SRX9122718","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"Oligo-dT","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":20668036,"base_count":3121928423,"first_public":"2020-09-16","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: RNA-Seq of homo sapiens"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN16132259","study_accession":"PRJNA663423","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_